{"4060750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trichramas", "steam_appid": 4060750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is the first title developed entirely by a South Korean university student.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is heavily influenced by Portal 1 &amp; 2 and Superliminal, and includes the classic fun of first-person puzzle games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay focuses on visual colors and precise timing for puzzle-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features jump maps, time-control device puzzles, and puzzles based on optical illusions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play time : 3~4 hours</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are</strong><br><br>an AI agent assigned to fix a virtual world where time has completely stopped. Infiltrate a security system that appears cute, yet remains unstable and unpredictable beneath the surface. Fully voiced companions will guide you through your mission as you uncover errors, restore order, and bring the world back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A first-person puzzle game in the form of a room escape with a jump map, optical illusions, and devices using the RGB concept of the three primary colors of light.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It consists of about 70 stages and various puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060750/extras/908be29854e565a453dc56bc6cacafb3.avif?t=1767552802\" width=1560 height=622 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Using Clock</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060750/extras/625abef764d7374babd36fdd8757db30.poster.avif?t=1767552802\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060750/extras/625abef764d7374babd36fdd8757db30.webm?t=1767552802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060750/extras/625abef764d7374babd36fdd8757db30.mp4?t=1767552802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Using Brush</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060750/extras/989a2d320ae9c868ea61545db63e6306.poster.avif?t=1767552802\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060750/extras/989a2d320ae9c868ea61545db63e6306.webm?t=1767552802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060750/extras/989a2d320ae9c868ea61545db63e6306.mp4?t=1767552802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Using Pocket watch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060750/extras/8f1c7f8b9ba287a5d6400f3aa466b3a4.poster.avif?t=1767552802\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060750/extras/8f1c7f8b9ba287a5d6400f3aa466b3a4.webm?t=1767552802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060750/extras/8f1c7f8b9ba287a5d6400f3aa466b3a4.mp4?t=1767552802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Colors that stand out in black and white graphics</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where time has stopped, control the time of colored objects and move them to solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060750/extras/4e12b1f9e2a8c3c9bc203410987f1483.poster.avif?t=1767552802\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060750/extras/4e12b1f9e2a8c3c9bc203410987f1483.webm?t=1767552802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060750/extras/4e12b1f9e2a8c3c9bc203410987f1483.mp4?t=1767552802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Precise timing and color settings</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set the color of the objects and create a path to cross by timing them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060750/extras/a0c0905efa4d0b1dac68cd0eb5703e39.poster.avif?t=1767552802\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060750/extras/a0c0905efa4d0b1dac68cd0eb5703e39.webm?t=1767552802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060750/extras/a0c0905efa4d0b1dac68cd0eb5703e39.mp4?t=1767552802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Creative classic puzzle game</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy novel and complex puzzles based on the classic first-person puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060750/extras/a1b7587054c0b29af8843d4ef6fa25e7.poster.avif?t=1767552802\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060750/extras/a1b7587054c0b29af8843d4ef6fa25e7.webm?t=1767552802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060750/extras/a1b7587054c0b29af8843d4ef6fa25e7.mp4?t=1767552802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Moderate difficulty</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a level of difficulty that anyone can enjoy, not so hard that it's frustrating, and not so easy that it's boring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Collect Easter eggs</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find nine different colored Easter eggs hidden throughout the map and bring back the colors of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060750/extras/016172bfb615f92ff75a8adf7bfd76f7.avif?t=1767552802\" width=1560 height=226 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is the first title developed entirely by a South Korean university student.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is heavily influenced by Portal 1 &amp; 2 and Superliminal, and includes the classic fun of first-person puzzle games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay focuses on visual colors and precise timing for puzzle-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features jump maps, time-control device puzzles, and puzzles based on optical illusions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play time : 3~4 hours</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are</strong><br><br>an AI agent assigned to fix a virtual world where time has completely stopped. Infiltrate a security system that appears cute, yet remains unstable and unpredictable beneath the surface. Fully voiced companions will guide you through your mission as you uncover errors, restore order, and bring the world back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A first-person puzzle game in the form of a room escape with a jump map, optical illusions, and devices using the RGB concept of the three primary colors of light.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It consists of about 70 stages and various puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060750/extras/908be29854e565a453dc56bc6cacafb3.avif?t=1767552802\" width=1560 height=622 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Using Clock</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060750/extras/625abef764d7374babd36fdd8757db30.poster.avif?t=1767552802\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060750/extras/625abef764d7374babd36fdd8757db30.webm?t=1767552802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060750/extras/625abef764d7374babd36fdd8757db30.mp4?t=1767552802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Using Brush</strong></p><p class=\"